{"id":"441277","name":"菜心玉米面糯米汤果","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/441277/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"70克"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"20克"},{"name":"菜心","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：糯米粉。","img":"images/441277/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"玉米面。","img":"images/441277/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"菜心。","img":"images/441277/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪油。","img":"images/441277/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将糯面粉和玉米面倒入大盆中。","img":"images/441277/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加一些水和成糯米团，待用。","img":"images/441277/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将菜心洗净捞出。","img":"images/441277/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放在案板上切开，待用。","img":"images/441277/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅置火上，倒入清水，搁点猪油。","img":"images/441277/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"烧开。","img":"images/441277/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"随后，取糯米团搓成长条，掰成小块下入锅中搅动一下煮开。","img":"images/441277/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"接着，合入菜心煮开，煮至菜心断生。","img":"images/441277/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后，加点盐、鸡精调味搅匀，即成。","img":"images/441277/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}